.TH dalgona-login 1  "dalgona-login " 
.SH NAME
dalgona\-login \- Sign in to a provider or inspect sign\-in state.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgona\-login\fR [\fB\-\-api\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-device\-auth\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPROVIDER\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sign in to a provider or inspect sign\-in state.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-key\fR
Read an API key from standard input.
.TP
\fB\-\-device\-auth\fR
Use the provider device\-auth flow.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPROVIDER\fR]

.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
dalgona\-login\-status(1)
Show provider sign\-in state.
.TP
dalgona\-login\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
